URL: https://github.com/sjp/selectrs
BugReports: https://github.com/sjp/selectrs/issues
Language: en-GB
Description: Translates a CSS selector into an equivalent XPath
  expression. A standalone, API-compatible port of the 'selectr'
  package with the parsing and translation core implemented in Rust
  via the 'css-to-xpath' crate. This allows searching XML documents
  using CSS selectors with the same results as 'selectr', but much
  faster.
